Caption:=20

  =20

Today's edition is sponsored by AWS Marketplace, on a choice a lot of you a=
re making right now: which vector database to build on.

   =20

Three AI patterns, one building block:

  =20

* **RAG** grounds your model in your data, not its training set.

* **Agentic memory** carries context across sessions.

* **Semantic search** matches intent, not keywords.

   =20

Each one runs on a **vector database**, and each puts different demands on =
it. So the right pick depends on your architecture, not on a feature list.

   =20

AWS Marketplace put together an evaluation guide to help you choose:

     =20

1. **Architecture diagrams:** each pattern mapped with Amazon Bedrock and A=
mazon Bedrock AgentCore.

2. **Evaluation framework:** hybrid search, scaling, hosting trade-offs, em=
bedding pipeline fit, and metadata filtering.

3. **Free trials:** test vector databases in AWS Marketplace against your o=
wn workload.

     =20

[Get the evaluation guide =E2=86=92](https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/bui=
ld-learn/vector-databases-for-ai?trk=3Dd3d0b769-6ac0-4810-97f5-8087578ab636=
&sc_channel=3Del)

    =20

   =20

**Why it's worth a look:**

 =20
Tools in AWS Marketplace are designed to plug into your AWS workflows. Eval=
uate fast with free trials and developer-tier pricing, avoid upfront licens=
e fees, and pay only for what you use, billed through your AWS account.

  =20

If you're picking a vector database this quarter, start with the architectu=
re.

